     "ex": {"en": "How old is your little sister?", "parts": [["你","nei5"],["細妹","sai3 mui2"],["幾多歲","gei2 do1 seoi3"],["啊","aa3"],["？"]]}},
    {"hk": "結婚", "jp": "git3 fan1", "en": "to marry", "fr": "se marier",
