    {"en": "Do you (all) like living in Geneva?", "parts": [["你哋","nei5 dei6"],["鍾唔鍾意","zung1 m4 zung1 ji3"],["住","zyu6"],["喺","hai2"],["日內瓦","jat6 noi6 ngaa5"],["啊","aa3"],["？"]]}
